{"id":"5698dbb792dca9ba","group":"67","path":"67/67-cor-finite-base-nonirredundant.md","title":"Finite Arithmetic Bases Have Extensions with No Effective Irredundant Axiomatization","display":"cor-finite-base-nonirredundant — Finite Arithmetic Bases Have Extensions with No Effective Irredundant Axiomatization","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-cor-finite-base-nonirredundant","aliases":["67-cor-finite-base-nonirredundant"],"display":"cor-finite-base-nonirredundant — Finite Arithmetic Bases Have Extensions with No Effective Irredundant Axiomatization","depends_on":["[[67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization]]","[[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"4","source_label":"Corollary 4","source_printed_pages":"58","source_pdf_pages":"69","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"来源陈述已核对；有限基理论转移论证已人工重建，继承Theorem4.7证明限制","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-cor-finite-base-nonirredundant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-cor-finite-base-nonirredundant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-finite-base-nonirredundant — Finite Arithmetic Bases Have Extensions with No Effective Irredundant Axiomatization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"57d3217ac67bc5a6\" href=\"?note=57d3217ac67bc5a6\" title=\"67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization\">67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Corollary 4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"58"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"69"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"来源陈述已核对；有限基理论转移论证已人工重建，继承Theorem4.7证明限制"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 是一致有限算术公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}\">\\(\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\eta\">\\(E_\\eta\\)</span> 在下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(\\bar k)\">\\(\\eta(\\bar k)\\)</span> 为对指定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的无捕获数词代入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\eta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\},\n\\qquad E_\\eta\\coloneqq\\{\\eta(\\bar k):k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\eta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\},\n\\qquad E_\\eta\\coloneqq\\{\\eta(\\bar k):k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Pi_1,\\Sigma_1\\}\\quad\n\\exists\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\neg\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}(T\\cup E_\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Pi_1,\\Sigma_1\\}\\quad\n\\exists\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\neg\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}(T\\cup E_\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary4.4。由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"57d3217ac67bc5a6\" href=\"?note=57d3217ac67bc5a6\" title=\"67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization\">67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization</a> 得相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 非 i.a. 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=T+E_\\eta\">\\(U=T+E_\\eta\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 有绝对不可冗余r.e.公理化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>，有限性给有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0\\subseteq Y\">\\(Y_0\\subseteq Y\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0\\vdash T\">\\(Y_0\\vdash T\\)</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0\">\\(Y_0\\)</span> 压成单个合取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>，则相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\theta\\}\\cup(Y\\setminus Y_0)\">\\(\\{\\theta\\}\\cup(Y\\setminus Y_0)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 等价。</p>\n<p>其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in Y\\setminus Y_0\">\\(y\\in Y\\setminus Y_0\\)</span> 仍不可冗余，否则用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0\\vdash T\">\\(Y_0\\vdash T\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0\\vdash\\theta\">\\(Y_0\\vdash\\theta\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\setminus\\{y\\}\\vdash y\">\\(Y\\setminus\\{y\\}\\vdash y\\)</span>，违背 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 的不可冗余性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 已由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+(Y\\setminus Y_0)\">\\(T+(Y\\setminus Y_0)\\)</span> 推出，则删掉它；否则保留它。无论哪种情形都给出相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的不可冗余r.e.公理化，矛盾。故结论是绝对非 i.a.，而非只针对一个原呈示的删减失败。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"57d3217ac67bc5a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-cla